# Global Archify wake (all projects)

Kit home: `~/Documents/Archify-kit/`  
Read `~/Documents/Archify-kit/WAKE.md` and `~/Documents/Archify-kit/RULES.md`.

## Resolve ARCHIFY_ROOT first

```bash
ARCHIFY_ROOT=$(bash ~/Documents/Archify-kit/tools/resolve-archify-root.sh "$(pwd)")
echo "$ARCHIFY_ROOT"
```

## Wake

> Make the archify of this project

1. Init if needed (`init-project-archify.sh`)
2. Orchestrator: `$ARCHIFY_ROOT` agents or kit `agents/00-orchestrator.md`
3. **Decide agent count automatically** via `plan-archify-agents.sh` (do not ask the user)
4. Generate diagrams under `$ARCHIFY_ROOT` only — never edit product source for Archify
5. **Always** open Live Guide when done:
   `bash ~/Documents/Archify-kit/tools/ensure-live-guide.sh "$ARCHIFY_ROOT" system`

Optional: `hint: quick` or `hint: deep` in the same message.
